# Docker build context ignore for the Backend/ directory.
# Host build artifacts leak machine-specific NuGet paths into the image and
# break in-container restore/publish; never copy them.

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.git/
**/*.user
**/Logs/
**/App_Data/
**/Uploads/
LaoHR.Tests/CoverageReport_Logic/
LaoHR.Tests/TestResults/
*.md
